# Alembic migrations

This directory contains the versioned PostgreSQL schema migrations for Mail Sentinel.

The database URL is loaded from the application settings in `app.core.config`,
so `.env` is the source of truth for both the application and Alembic.

Typical commands, run from `backend/`:

```bash
alembic current
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
alembic upgrade head
alembic downgrade -1
```

Do not edit generated migration files after the schema has been reviewed unless
the change is intentional and the migration is revalidated.
